north-star.md §5 (new): energy-as-generator closed-negative (Sudoku v1-v4 + exp3882
EBT kill-gate + exp3883 K-curve + NVIDIA-Ising QEC corroboration); Carnot = the
HYBRID's energy VERIFIER (generator is commodity LLM / third-party TRM refiner,
~0.82 standalone no-energy). This CONCENTRATES all risk on the verifier, whose value
is unproven (exp3885 moat inconclusive; energy-rerank hurt; domain-bound). Win
condition = efficiency-parity (equally effective at lower cost) + accuracy upside
(Pareto). Hardware repurposed to energy EVALUATION (verify), not minimization.

known-issues.md: new TOP MANDATORY-NEXT-MILESTONE PRIORITY 'VERIFIER-EARNS-ITS-PLACE
PROOF' — supersedes generator/breadth work. Two experiments: (1) infra-fixed
moat-scissor accuracy rerun (does external verifier catch what self-verify misses);
(2) energy-verifier vs LLM-as-judge cost/latency head-to-head at matched accuracy
('parity at 10-100x cheaper'). Re-scope Phase-3 to the hybrid.

